    "main_topic": [
      {
        "h_title": "Visit the best beaches on Koh Tao. Swim in crystal clear waters, sink into white sands, soak up the sun, and relax surrounded by nature.",
        "main_title": "Spotlight Koh Tao 2025 at Sairee Beach",
        "author": null,
        "language": "en",
        "level": 1,
        "primary_content": [
          {
            "text": "No tropical paradise island getaway is complete without a few days lazing your cares away on the beach. Take in the sounds of the ocean, sip on a cocktail or fresh coconut, swim and snorkel around the shallow coral reefs, and dry off under the cool sea breeze provided by gently swaying palm trees.",
            "url": null,
            "urls": null
          },
          {
            "text": "There are so many beaches on Koh Tao to choose from, and we hope you’ll have time to explore them all during your stay. You’ll find rental services at all of the beaches in populated areas if you don’t have your own mask and snorkel. Some beaches even offer kayak and paddleboard rental.",
            "url": null,
            "urls": null
          },
          {
            "text": "Please note that access fees apply at some beaches on Koh Tao, so we recommend carrying some change with you when you visit.",
            "url": null,
            "urls": null
          }
        ],
        "secondary_content": [
          {
            "text": "THE MOST POPULAR BEACHES ON KOH TAO • BEST BEACHES ON KOH TAO FOR SNORKELING • REMOTE BEACHES ON KOH TAO",
            "url": "https://visitkohtao.org/detail-sub/3/22/46/beaches/",
            "urls": [
              {
                "url": "https://visitkohtao.org/detail-sub/3/22/46/beaches/",
                "anchor_text": "THE MOST POPULAR BEACHES ON KOH TAO"
              },
              {
