      {
        "h_title": "The Most Popular Beaches on Koh Tao",
        "main_title": "Spotlight Koh Tao 2025 at Sairee Beach",
        "author": null,
        "language": "en",
        "level": 1,
        "primary_content": [
          {
            "text": "The most popular beaches on Koh Tao are easy to get to and have a selection of on-site services and facilities for food, drinks, and sunbeds, etc.",
            "url": null,
            "urls": null
          }
        ],
        "secondary_content": null,
        "table_content": null
      },
      {
        "h_title": "Best Beaches on Koh Tao for Snorkeling",
        "main_title": "Spotlight Koh Tao 2025 at Sairee Beach",
        "author": null,
        "language": "en",
        "level": 1,
        "primary_content": [
          {
            "text": "The best beaches on Koh Tao for snorkeling have wide sweeping bays, shallow coral reefs, and easy access from the shoreline. Many also have specific attractions like a small wreck to explore (Mae Haad) or opportunities to spot turtles and blacktip reef sharks (Shark Bay).",
            "url": null,
            "urls": null
          }
        ],
        "secondary_content": null,
        "table_content": null
      },
      {
        "h_title": "Remote Beaches on Koh Tao",
        "main_title": "Spotlight Koh Tao 2025 at Sairee Beach",
        "author": null,
        "language": "en",
        "level": 1,
        "primary_content": [
          {
            "text": "Want to get away from it all and get a patch of golden sand all to yourself? At some of these remote beaches on Koh Tao, that’s definitely possible! Not all are accessible by road, so some require a longtail taxi or hike to reach. But we think you’ll find the effort worth it.",
            "url": null,
            "urls": null
          }
        ],
        "secondary_content": null,
        "table_content": null
      }
    ],
